AC

take first character and set it aside
>,>

input the rest as an array
>,----------[++++++++++>,----------]<

move the first character to the end of the array
[<]<[->>[>]>+<<[<]<]

subtract first character from last character
>>[>]<[->>-<<]>>

not flag
[[-]>-<]>+

output Yes if 1 else No
[[-]+[--->++<]>+++.[->++++<]>+.[--->+<]>----.>>>-<]>+[[-]-[--->+<]>-------.-[--->+<]>.[-]]